Package: precommitr
Title: Shared Pre-Commit Hooks for R Analysts
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Quinten",
           family = "Sandberg",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "quinten.sandberg@hotmail.com")
Description: A small wrapper around the 'pre-commit' framework that ships an
    opinionated, organisation-wide configuration for R projects. Provides
    use_precommits() to drop the shared .pre-commit-config.yaml into a repo
    and activate its git hooks. All hooks are 'repo: local' and dispatched
    through run_hook(), so the hooks work fully offline once 'precommitr'
    and the 'pre-commit' binary are installed -- no git-cloning of
    external hook repos required.
